        "Swipe",
        "Réflexe",
        "Course"
      ]
    },
    "en": {
      "tagline": "Three ropes of light that cross and cross again in a hypnotic run. Swipe fast to dodge the traps or grab different bonuses. The further you go, the higher your score climbs.",
      "tags": [
        "Swipe",
        "Reflex",
        "Run"
      ]
    }
  },
  "description": "Three ropes of light run up the void, curling into loops and crossing each other. Swipe to hop the arrow from one to the next: gems and power-ups pay, mines and traps cost, and the run only ends when the third life does.",
